# A loft held square to a profile between its ends: loft_ring.tlspr's
# smooth loft through six circles, its screen shown from the group list,
# the third profile's [change] given 1; the screen, then the solid
# checked.
file $testdata/ui/loft_ring.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
twmove 137 400
twdown L 137 400
twup L 137 400
twmove 263 170
twdown L 263 170
twup L 263 170
edit 1
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
